import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 743 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Life-Cycle System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 743 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Life-Cycle System","no":743,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals","Life-Cycle","Origin Three Bases","Longevity Engineering","Myriad-Rank Symbiosis"],"related":["12-Life-Cycle System Details","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","07-Self-Generated Self-Grown Evolution Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0743_模块4-超多元级功法-生命循环体系应用.md","filePath":"en/0743_模块4-超多元级功法-生命循环体系应用.md"}'),l={name:"en/0743_模块4-超多元级功法-生命循环体系应用.md"};function o(r,e,s,c,u,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-743-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-hyper-multiverse-applications-of-the-life-cycle-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 743 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Life-Cycle System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-743-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-hyper-multiverse-applications-of-the-life-cycle-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 743 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Life-Cycle System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 12, 15, 07</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-upgrade-live-this-life-well-to-let-life-be-civilization-s-perpetual-motion-engine" tabindex="-1">Introduction: upgrade &quot;live this life well&quot; to &quot;let life be civilization&#39;s perpetual-motion engine&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-upgrade-live-this-life-well-to-let-life-be-civilization-s-perpetual-motion-engine" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: upgrade &quot;live this life well&quot; to &quot;let life be civilization&#39;s perpetual-motion engine&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Life-Cycle System is the Origin Cultivation System&#39;s No. 2 origin base system (number 002). Per benchmark Document 12, its core is life energy&#39;s internal cycle — energy absorbed by the cultivator forms a closed loop in the body, continuously nourishing the flesh, extending lifespan, and raising vitality. Under the nine-realm framework, this is a personal longevity and wellness manual. But at the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, its role must leap — from &quot;letting one person live longer&quot; to &quot;letting Myriad Ranks&#39; life cycle be civilization&#39;s perpetual engine.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are the life cycle&#39;s coordinate system: the anti-predation axiom requires life energy all come from creation and cycle, not devouring; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires longevity technology be open to 99% of clans; the collective ascension axiom requires long-lived ones take on perpetual construction, not hang up; the causal self-discipline axiom requires cross-plane life transplantation go through reporting procedure; the law-first axiom requires the life cycle&#39;s law definition be self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-origin-grade-personal-life-internal-cycle" tabindex="-1">I. Origin Grade: Personal Life Internal Cycle <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-origin-grade-personal-life-internal-cycle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Origin Grade: Personal Life Internal Cycle&quot;">​</a></h2><p>At origin grade, the Life-Cycle System&#39;s functions are:</p><ul><li>Establish an internal closed loop of body energy, reducing energy leakage;</li><li>Nourish the flesh and divine soul, extending natural lifespan;</li><li>Repair cultivation damage, maintaining vigorous vitality;</li><li>Provide life-energy reserves for breaking through higher realms.</li></ul><p>This grade serves a single cultivator; the effect is &quot;live longer, be healthier.&quot; But it has an old-web-novel common disease: if longevity itself is not paired with construction duty, it is equal to creating a hotbed for hang-up retirement — the longer you live, the longer you lie flat.</p><h2 id="ii-multiverse-grade-plane-level-life-ecology" tabindex="-1">II. Multiverse Grade: Plane-Level Life Ecology <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-multiverse-grade-plane-level-life-ecology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Multiverse Grade: Plane-Level Life Ecology&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After entering the Multiverse Realm, the Life-Cycle System&#39;s service object leaps from individual to plane ecology:</p><ul><li><strong>Plane life-energy balance</strong>: monitor the whole plane&#39;s life-energy cycle, preventing ecological depletion from over-extraction;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank longevity engineering</strong>: design adapted longevity schemes for different races, not force humankind&#39;s longevity technique onto plant spirits or mechanical clans;</li><li>** Life-death cycle optimization**: optimize the individual life&#39;s birth-aging-sickness-death cycle, letting every lifetime&#39;s experience be backflowed through the Alaya Network, not dissipating with death;</li><li><strong>Cross-plane life transplantation</strong>: safely migrate endangered races from a doomed plane to a new plane, strictly following causal self-discipline reporting procedure.</li></ul><p>This grade no longer concerns &quot;how long one person lives,&quot; but &quot;whether the whole plane&#39;s life ecology is healthy and sustainable.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-hyper-multiverse-grade-civilization-level-life-perpetuity-engineering" tabindex="-1">III. Hyper-Multiverse Grade: Civilization-Level Life Perpetuity Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-hyper-multiverse-grade-civilization-level-life-perpetuity-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Hyper-Multiverse Grade: Civilization-Level Life Perpetuity Engineering&quot;">​</a></h2><p>At the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, the Life-Cycle System enters a third layer — civilization-level life perpetuity engineering. It is no longer a &quot;wellness technique,&quot; but a whole set of life infrastructure for civilization itself to run perpetually:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Engineering Direction</th><th>Specific Content</th><th>Service Object</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Immortal-on-post system</td><td>Longevity must be paired with perpetual-construction duty; &quot;immortality + hang-up&quot; is forbidden</td><td>Balanced-Anchor-level strong ones</td></tr><tr><td>Experience-lineage immortality</td><td>A lifetime&#39;s cultivation experience is permanently preserved through the Alaya Network; death does not zero out experience</td><td>All Myriad Ranks</td></tr><tr><td>Civilizational metabolism</td><td>Let civilization have metabolism like a living being — old technology exits, new technology goes on post, rather than piling heavier and heavier</td><td>The whole civilization</td></tr><tr><td>Cross-cosmos life backup</td><td>Establish life backups for each race in the cross-cosmos anchor network, preventing plane destruction from causing race extinction</td><td>Endangered races</td></tr><tr><td>Life-weight balance</td><td>Monitor lifespan gaps across races, preventing some races from monopolizing civilizational weight through extreme longevity</td><td>Myriad-Rank co-governance</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="iv-key-constraint-longevity-is-not-privilege" tabindex="-1">IV. Key Constraint: Longevity Is Not Privilege <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-key-constraint-longevity-is-not-privilege" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Key Constraint: Longevity Is Not Privilege&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou has an iron rule for Life-Cycle-System applications: <strong>longevity technology&#39;s returns are strictly bound to construction duty.</strong></p><ul><li>Natural longevity extension from Sense-Origin to Origin Realm: no additional duty attached, because cultivators at this stage are still growing;</li><li>Multiverse Realm longevity technology: attached civilizational-engineering participation requirement; the long-lived must participate in at least one long-term project;</li><li>Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm immortality-grade longevity: attached permanent-on-post duty; the immortal is a living anchor; retirement = weightlessness.</li></ul><p>This institutionally prevents the old-web-novel path of &quot;cultivate to immortality then hang up and retire.&quot; You may live ten thousand years, but those ten thousand years must be construction ten thousand years, not indulgence ten thousand years.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: if the Life-Cycle System only serves personal longevity, it wastes civilization-level technology on a few people&#39;s immortality; hyper-multiverse applications let longevity serve civilizational perpetuity</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: life energy all comes from internal cycle and increment creation; extending longevity by devouring other life is forbidden — this is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s concrete landing in the life domain</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s longevity is gift-style — whoever Gu Chensha lets live lives; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s longevity is institutional — everyone may learn, everyone may enjoy, but must take construction duty</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: longevity engineering is separately designed per the five lineages (carbon/energy/mechanical/consciousness/mixed), not a humankind patent</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the Life-Cycle System&#39;s whole technology — from personal internal cycle to civilization-level metabolism — is open network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Life-Cycle System upgrades from &quot;letting people live longer&quot; to &quot;letting civilization run perpetually&quot;; the core shift is redefining life from &quot;personal asset&quot; to &quot;civilization public resource.&quot; A Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivator&#39;s longevity is not his privilege, but his post — however long he lives, he constructs for that long.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/12-生命循环体系详解.html">Entry 12 · Life-Cycle System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/07-自生自长进化法则.html">Entry 07 · Self-Generated Self-Grown Evolution Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">Entry 26 · Individual-Collective Balance Principle</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const y=i(l,[["render",o]]);export{d as __pageData,y as default};
